ex":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1526204004:1":{"text":"盗もうとしたわけじゃない！あいや、その、何も盗んでない！だから許してくれ！","source_cn":"我们什么都没拿！不是，我们也没想拿什么！放过我们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x822764868E22F4F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1526204005:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">小麦を盗もうとした</style>のか？","source_cn":"你们想<style=highlight>窃取小麦</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48355959082921D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1526204006:1":{"text":"ち、違う！","source_cn":"我……我们没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4431C37415C18A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1526204007:1":{"text":"なら、そのカバンに入っているのは何だ？","source_cn":"那你包里的是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA9413002B5F542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1526204008:1":{"text":"ごめんなさいっ……私たち、お腹が空いて、仕方なくて……","source_cn":"对不起……我、我们太饿了，实在受不了，只能……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4DD9FBF7D946325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1526204009:1":{"text":"なんだと？ホーリン城には、バルトシアから定期的に小麦を運んでいるだろ。","source_cn":"饿？水泽营地一直按期将小麦送到呼临城，为什么你们还会挨饿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E950D5D5344639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1526204010:1":{"text":"そうだけど、あれだけじゃ足りなくて……届く量も減る一方だし……","source_cn":"……你们送来的小麦太少了，分到我们手里的更是一次比一次少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EE1674A6E02FED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1526204011:1":{"text":"食べ物があるだけでもありがたいけど、うちには子どもが大勢いるから、全員に行き渡らないのよ……","source_cn":"虽然说是有的吃就不错，但像我们这种家里孩子多的，难免还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A8E632EF533BD8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1526204012:1":{"text":"小麦の収穫量が減ったのはヤクボルのせいじゃない。豊穣神がよこしたスピロクタスに、バルトシアが襲われているんだ。","source_cn":"水泽营地的麦田收成不好。这不是雅库伯尔的责任，而是因为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B72C2F46E34D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1526204013:1":{"text":"お前たちも見ただろ。今日はあれで三度目の襲撃だ。","source_cn":"你们刚刚也看到了针蝗，它们已经是今天袭击水泽营地的第三波。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25830F5879CC9D6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:152