:"195338","variant_female_record_index":"195339","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1526206006":{"text":"お前も同じ――いや、おれ以上に分かっているはずだろう。","source_cn":"……那种感受，恐怕你比我更清楚。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4976EE41A30AA168","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"お前も同じ――いや、おれ以上に分かっているはずだろう。","female":"お前も同じ――いや、おれ以上に分かっているはずだろう。","variant_male_record_index":"195338","variant_female_record_index":"195339","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1526206007:0":{"text":"同情じゃない。","source_cn":"不是同情。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F15AAEBC8C556B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"同情じゃない。","female":"同情じゃない。","variant_male_record_index":"195340","variant_female_record_index":"195341","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1526206008:0":{"text":"少しだけ……あいつらの気持ちが分かっただけだ。","source_cn":"或许只是一点……感同身受。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BB60954DD15D5EC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"少しだけ……あいつらの気持ちが分かっただけだ。","female":"少しだけ……あいつらの気持ちが分かっただけだ。","variant_male_record_index":"195342","variant_female_record_index":"195343","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1526206010:0":{"text":"ホーリンを襲うスピロクタス、ヤクボルを攻撃する獣……豊穣神の所業は、もはや狩猟神と何ら変わりない。","source_cn":"针蝗袭击呼临，野兽攻击雅库伯尔。丰饶神如今的行径，和狩...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBC729D5787DED77C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ホーリンを襲うスピロクタス、ヤクボルを攻撃する獣……豊穣神の所業は、もはや狩猟神と何ら変わりない。","female":"ホーリンを襲うスピロクタス、ヤクボルを攻撃する獣……豊穣神の所業は、もはや狩猟神と何ら変わりない。","variant_male_record_index":"195346","variant_female_record_index":"195347","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1526206011:0":{"text":"これ以上、神が権能を振りかざして人々を傷つけるようなことがあってはならないんだ。","source_cn":"神凭借神威伤害凡人……这种事不该再发生。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x265CAF9A83E7A076","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"これ以上、神が権能を振りかざして人々を傷つけるようなことがあってはならないんだ。","female":"これ以上、神が権能を振りかざして人々を傷つけるようなことがあってはならないんだ。","variant_male_record_index":"195348","variant_female_record_index":"195349","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1526206012:0":{"text":"だからおれは、豊穣神が消滅するまで、生きるためにもがく人間を責めたりはしない。","source_cn":"所以在丰饶神陨落之前，我不会苛责挣扎求活的呼临人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8AC298B5DCF080","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"だからおれは、豊穣神が消滅するまで、生きるためにもがく人間を責めたりはしない。","female":"だからおれは、豊穣神が消滅するまで、生きるためにもがく人間を責めたりはしない。","variant_male_record_index":"195350","variant_female_record_index":"195351","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1526206013:0":{"text":"生きたいと願うのは、罪じゃないからな。","source_cn":"想活下去，不是他们的罪。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9734B481FD67D57D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"生きたいと願うのは、罪じゃないからな。","female":"生きたいと願うのは、罪じゃないからな。","variant_male_record_index":"195352","variant_female_record_index":"195353","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"だから人間に同情したのか？","source_cn":"所以你很同情呼临人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x758EFADF53AA16BF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"だから人間に同情したのか？","female":"だから人間に同情したの？","variant_male_record_index":"80997","variant_female_record_index":"80998","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fema